      "durationSec": 285,
      "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g9Y6feWAvII/mqdefault.jpg",
      "description": "With Gilius Thunderhead (Matthew Rhys) facing his demise at the hands of the town executioner (Richard Kind), Hampton Squib (Danny Pudi) interrupts with a dramatic revelation about the people’s beloved bard, Thaxton (Bashir Salahuddin). Luckily, Janzu (Haley Joel Osment) and Druda (Stephanie Beatriz) are also there to help fend off Thaxton and his warrior bards. Season 1, Episode 7: The Cold Bard Truth\n\nStream Golden Axe on Paramount+.\n\nIn an homage to SEGA’s iconic 1989 video game, Golden Axe follows legendary warriors Ax Battler, Tyris Flare and Gilius Thunderhead as they reunite to save Yuria from the evil giant Death Adder, who just won’t seem to stay dead. Their quest is complicated by Hampton Squib, an inexperienced and wildly underprepared adventurer whose dream of heroism far exceeds his abilities. Forced to work together despite their flaws, they must find a way to stop Death Adder once and for all.\n\nLike Paramount+ on Facebook: https://bit.ly/PPlusFacebook\nFollow Paramount+ on X: https://bit.ly/PPlusOnX\nFollow Paramount+ on Instagram: https://bit.ly/PPlusInstagram\nFollow Paramount+ on Threads: https://bit.ly/PPlusThreads\nFollow Paramount+ on TikTok: https://bit.ly/PPlusTikTok\n\nWith Paramount+ you can stream over 40,000 episodes and movies from CBS, BET, Comedy Central, MTV, Nickelodeon, Smithsonian Channel, Paramount Pictures, and SHOWTIME® including exclusive originals, live sports, and news.\n\nPlus, you can count on Paramount+ for the most iconic movies and the latest in live sports and news with your local CBS station, CBS News, CBS Sports HQ, and Mixible.\n\nSubscribe now and get streaming! https://bit.ly/SubscribeToPPlus\n\nStream on Paramount+ where Paramount+ is available.\n\n#GoldenAxe #SEGA #ParamountPlus",
